WEBVTT

00:15:58.912 --> 00:16:02.165
and Afghanistan slips
from the front pages,

00:16:02.165 --> 00:16:03.583
do not look away.

00:16:05.377 --> 00:16:08.296
In nine years, it will be the year 2030.

00:16:09.798 --> 00:16:14.803
It's the year I will celebrate
my 40th birthday.

00:16:16.888 --> 00:16:19.266
So here is my dream,

00:16:19.266 --> 00:16:20.642
my birthday wish.

00:16:22.185 --> 00:16:24.354
In nine years,

00:16:24.354 --> 00:16:26.982
I hope to be speaking with you again

00:16:29.317 --> 00:16:32.654
from SOLA’s campus in Kabul,